#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/qvae_cell.md:5
msgid ""
"Single-cell representation learning with a quantum variational autoencoder "
"(QVAE): read a single-cell expression matrix, train a QVAE, extract low-"
"dimensional representations, compute UMAP, analyze the energy distribution, "
"and evaluate clustering quality against cell-type labels."
msgstr ""
"Single-cell representation learning with a quantum variational autoencoder "
"(QVAE): read a single-cell expression matrix, train a QVAE, extract low-"
"dimensional representations, compute UMAP, analyze the energy distribution, "
"and evaluate clustering quality against cell-type labels."

